  "construction_notes": [
    {
      "text": "From the state Housing Element Annual Progress Report, through 2025.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001129",
        "SRC-001123"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The state report's rows for this project also name 10 Miraluna Dr, 12 Miraluna Dr, 3300 College Dr, 521 San Anselmo. These may be separate projects, and the unit count may include them.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001129",
        "SRC-001123"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "College Ridge: two three-story buildings of 15 units each, 1, 2 and 3 bedroom apartments, one covered parking space per unit, EV charging, designed to LEED Gold. Units are assigned to college faculty and staff at below-market rates.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003562"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "State report rows for 3300 College Dr (APN 017-080-150) show 30 rental units: 6 low-income and 5 moderate-income deed-restricted, plus 19 low-income units not deed-restricted that the district says will serve low-income faculty families; 55-year term.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001123"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The district sold Parcel B at the campus edge to SummerHill Homes, which planned 40 single-family homes on the adjoining land; SF YIMBY reports the 40 homes were built by D.R. Horton.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003563",
        "SRC-003564"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The record's parcel 020-162-020 and address 837 7th Ave match a one-unit ADU in the state report (ADU 20-013; certificate of occupancy 2021-08-13), not the Skyline College housing at 3300 College Dr. Planning file ADU20-020 belongs to 521 San Anselmo Ave in the state report.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001129",
        "SRC-001123"
      ]
    }
  ],
